WEBVTT

01:28.530 --> 01:32.250
Our Secret
EP02

01:40.010 --> 01:41.119
In this paragraph,

01:41.369 --> 01:43.250
the only useful thing is this formula.

01:43.760 --> 01:45.250
You only have to bear it in mind.

01:45.649 --> 01:46.800
If you keep your habit of

01:46.970 --> 01:48.080
memorizing everything,

01:48.440 --> 01:50.250
you may be weeded out from the key class.

01:54.440 --> 01:56.399
You were merely
above the admission score.

01:56.800 --> 01:57.970
You're in the 45th place,
while I'm in the 38th place.

01:58.119 --> 01:59.440
What makes you judge me?

02:05.010 --> 02:06.720
It is your first time being despised for poor academic performance.

02:07.120 --> 02:09.360
Siyue, your deskmate is funny.

02:09.690 --> 02:12.080
Come on, stop mocking at Ding Xian.

02:12.560 --> 02:14.490
Since you joined this class midway,
you may not know that

02:14.690 --> 02:15.970
Siyue has always been the top student

02:16.130 --> 02:17.250
in the main campus.

02:17.410 --> 02:18.610
And he was a contestant of National Olympiad.

02:19.050 --> 02:21.160
He prepared for the Robotics Contest
before the entrance examination.

02:21.410 --> 02:22.560
So he didn't take the exam seriously.

02:22.800 --> 02:24.080
Nonetheless, he got the full score in math.

02:26.410 --> 02:27.050
Well.

02:27.210 --> 02:27.850
Siyue

02:27.850 --> 02:30.210
I don't quite understand teacher's explanation on this in the last class.

02:30.640 --> 02:32.210
Can you help me with it? This one.

02:34.640 --> 02:35.800
Could you please move away?

03:09.330 --> 03:10.160
Xianxian

03:14.050 --> 03:15.130
I've been looking for you all around.

03:15.330 --> 03:16.280
You are here.

03:18.640 --> 03:19.520
What's wrong?

03:19.690 --> 03:20.800
Why pulled a long face?

03:24.490 --> 03:26.160
Don't you take classes?
You are in the third year.

03:27.969 --> 03:28.969
It's a free study class.

03:29.160 --> 03:30.000
It's all right.

03:40.610 --> 03:41.280
Come with me.

03:41.690 --> 03:43.000
I'll take you to a great place.

03:54.490 --> 03:55.969
This is my secret base.

03:56.440 --> 03:57.800
I share it with you today.

04:14.000 --> 04:15.560
Now you can tell me why.

04:19.890 --> 04:21.090
It's nothing serious.

04:22.560 --> 04:25.090
I just feel the gap between me
and those classmates from the main campus

04:26.050 --> 04:27.400
is huge.

04:30.770 --> 04:32.090
I roughly got it.

04:35.490 --> 04:36.840
That's nothing to be shocked about.

04:37.160 --> 04:38.090
Don't forget that

04:38.330 --> 04:40.560
I came to Shenhai two years
earlier than you.

04:41.049 --> 04:42.840
The feel at the start of
the first semester of the first grade,

04:44.610 --> 04:45.840
I know it so well.

04:46.560 --> 04:48.049
Did you get the same feeling as me?

04:49.720 --> 04:51.560
But I was not as depressed as you,

04:51.610 --> 04:53.240
trying to find somewhere to cry.

04:58.530 --> 05:00.049
I got your feeling.

05:01.120 --> 05:02.720
When I just came to Shenhai.

05:03.050 --> 05:04.400
I was in a similar situation as you.

05:05.440 --> 05:06.680
I didn't know anyone.

05:07.440 --> 05:09.120
I couldn't adapt
to the new environment.

05:09.890 --> 05:11.650
The school in my mind

05:11.890 --> 05:13.050
was just a place to study.

05:13.490 --> 05:15.120
But after I came to Shenhai,

05:15.330 --> 05:17.370
my whole worldview has been overturned.

05:18.400 --> 05:19.890
It also made me realize that

05:20.160 --> 05:22.720
school was not just a place to study.

05:23.530 --> 05:25.930
These were all brand new stuff to me.

05:26.440 --> 05:28.120
But for the guys from the main campus

05:28.330 --> 05:29.440
who live in the city,

05:29.610 --> 05:30.810
they all have got used to it.

05:32.120 --> 05:33.890
They had a broader vision than me.

05:34.330 --> 05:36.650
Even the scores
that I have always been proud of

05:37.120 --> 05:39.160
is nothing special here.

05:42.530 --> 05:43.370
It turns out that

05:43.560 --> 05:45.400
even you also have this feeling.

05:47.240 --> 05:49.650
To be honest,
I envy those guys from the main campus.

05:50.049 --> 05:52.120
They know much
and they are good at learning.

05:53.400 --> 05:55.120
Maybe we are not

05:57.680 --> 05:59.680
in the same world.

06:01.160 --> 06:02.400
Don't think that way.

06:03.120 --> 06:04.490
It's true that there is a gap between

06:04.810 --> 06:06.280
us and them.

06:06.680 --> 06:07.930
But you shouldn't immerse yourself

06:07.930 --> 06:09.720
in the gap.

06:10.280 --> 06:11.400
Knowledge and vision

06:11.610 --> 06:13.210
can be acquired by learning.

06:13.610 --> 06:14.960
But the most important thing is

06:16.280 --> 06:17.770
we're already here.

06:27.810 --> 06:30.000
Siyue, can you explain the question
to me again?

06:30.160 --> 06:31.280
I'm still a little confused.

06:35.330 --> 06:36.440
Wait for a minute, please.

06:40.000 --> 06:40.810
Xianxian

06:41.680 --> 06:42.490
Promise me.

06:43.610 --> 06:44.680
Don't give up

06:47.210 --> 06:48.770
in Shenhai.

06:51.240 --> 06:52.090
That's okay.

06:52.330 --> 06:53.810
I think we can change seats.

06:53.890 --> 06:55.280
You can sit here.

07:02.210 --> 07:03.530
What are you doing?

07:04.120 --> 07:05.650
I'm making room

07:05.720 --> 07:06.890
for you to explain questions.

07:07.770 --> 07:08.770
I'm almost done.

07:10.770 --> 07:12.120
Don't come back if you change now.

07:21.050 --> 07:22.680
I gotta go back to get my things.

07:30.210 --> 07:30.890
Thanks.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.650
Let me tell you what Ding Juncong has done.

08:13.210 --> 08:14.720
He deliberately made trouble for his sister.

08:14.930 --> 08:16.440
He hid his sister's school ID card.

08:16.610 --> 08:18.120
I spent all day looking for it.

08:21.560 --> 08:22.680
This brat!

08:24.680 --> 08:26.440
How about Ding Xian in school?

08:26.890 --> 08:27.810
I don't know.

08:28.400 --> 08:30.160
I haven't got the chance to talk with her the whole day.

08:33.360 --> 08:35.600
Why are you sighing?

08:37.439 --> 08:39.210
Don't you feel that Xianxian has been

08:39.530 --> 08:41.210
drifting apart from us recently.

08:42.290 --> 08:44.170
How fast she grows!

08:44.530 --> 08:45.600
I remember when she was young,

08:45.800 --> 08:46.600
she toddled

08:46.770 --> 08:48.040
behind us.

08:48.210 --> 08:50.170
Now she has grown up,
she doesn't like to be with us anymore.

08:52.040 --> 08:54.680
Don't fuss.

08:55.330 --> 08:57.170
She is almost sixteen years old now.

08:57.890 --> 08:59.240
It would be abnormal

08:59.360 --> 09:00.410
if she likes to be with us.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.360
After several years, everything will be better.

09:04.290 --> 09:06.650
You'd better spend your time
on disciplining her and her younger brother

09:06.970 --> 09:09.240
instead of sighing here.

09:09.410 --> 09:11.240
It is enough to discipline them by you.

09:16.290 --> 09:17.210
Ding Juncong

09:17.440 --> 09:19.090
has been in her sister's room for quite a while.

09:19.240 --> 09:19.970
What is he doing there?

09:23.680 --> 09:24.970
Dad and mom. I'm home.

09:25.920 --> 09:27.120
Xianxian, you're home.

09:27.210 --> 09:28.920
-Have some fruit.  -No, pass me.

09:30.170 --> 09:31.120
I knew it.

09:31.330 --> 09:32.480
I was right.

09:34.970 --> 09:35.890
Ding Juncong

09:37.850 --> 09:38.650
What are you doing in my room?

09:38.650 --> 09:39.650
Did I allow you to come in?

09:39.770 --> 09:41.970
You didn't lock your room,
so I entered.

09:44.560 --> 09:45.650
Did you read my diary?

09:45.730 --> 09:46.360
No, I didn't.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.040
Then why are you holding my diary?

09:47.040 --> 09:47.850
I didn't read it.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.210
Are you sure?

09:50.970 --> 09:51.920
Ding Juncong

09:52.120 --> 09:53.560
Mom, my sister is going to hit me.

09:54.560 --> 09:55.210
-Mom.  -What's up?

09:55.210 --> 09:56.120
You wanna die?

09:56.560 --> 09:57.000
What's the matter?

09:57.000 --> 09:57.890
Mom, see.

09:59.560 --> 10:00.560
Why don't you use your own notebook?

10:00.560 --> 10:00.920
Mom

10:00.920 --> 10:01.800
Why did you have to use mine?

10:02.770 --> 10:03.600
Alright.

10:03.920 --> 10:05.360
It's just a notebook.

10:07.440 --> 10:08.210
Your brother is young and ignorant,

10:08.240 --> 10:09.330
so are you?

10:10.890 --> 10:11.770
Furthermore,

10:12.040 --> 10:13.560
the time you spend on the diary

10:13.730 --> 10:15.210
is enough for you to finish a set of exercising papers.

10:17.040 --> 10:18.240
He didn't do it on purpose.

10:18.410 --> 10:20.240
Why did you lose your temper?

10:21.290 --> 10:22.770
The diary didn't affect my study.

10:23.170 --> 10:24.890
It was him who got the bad grades, not me.

10:25.170 --> 10:26.650
Why do you lecture me, instead of him?

10:26.800 --> 10:28.000
Am I not your daughter?

10:31.330 --> 10:32.530
How dare you talk to me like this?

10:35.530 --> 10:37.000
How dare you?

10:41.090 --> 10:42.530
Do you know how difficult I'm every day?

10:42.680 --> 10:43.290
I take care of your food

10:43.410 --> 10:44.530
and dressing.

10:45.440 --> 10:46.120
You are a big girl.

10:46.290 --> 10:47.560
Can't you just be nice to your brother?

10:47.730 --> 10:48.240
Alright, alright.

10:48.410 --> 10:49.210
Why did you argue with him?

10:49.330 --> 10:49.890
Alight, alright.

10:49.890 --> 10:51.600
Stop arguing, both of you.

10:52.290 --> 10:53.480
Xianxian, don't get angry.

10:53.680 --> 10:54.770
You go to your room first.

10:55.000 --> 10:55.650
By the way.

10:55.890 --> 10:57.650
Your mother found it for you.

11:03.920 --> 11:07.090
Next time if I find anyone who doesn't wear the school badge,

11:07.850 --> 11:09.530
go home right away!

11:30.120 --> 11:31.000
Such a naughty boy.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.210
Don't cry.

11:38.440 --> 11:39.440
You can't cry.

12:14.120 --> 12:15.000
Come in.

12:16.290 --> 12:17.290
Siyue

12:19.040 --> 12:20.600
I bought some Golden Cakes

12:20.680 --> 12:22.170
from Deyue Shop this afternoon.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.240
It's really delicious.

12:24.000 --> 12:25.800
Don't forget to bring some to Xianxian.

12:27.680 --> 12:29.240
Xianxian is fresh here,

12:29.480 --> 12:30.770
and she is in the same class as you.

12:31.090 --> 12:32.800
Take care of her in school.

12:33.170 --> 12:35.170
She is a girl, don't make her sad.

12:35.770 --> 12:37.850
Alright, I get it.

12:38.530 --> 12:39.530
Sleep early.

12:50.170 --> 12:51.040
Ding Wencheng

12:51.360 --> 12:53.120
Hurry up and stop siting
in front of your computer.

12:53.600 --> 12:54.360
The previous school

12:54.530 --> 12:56.560
is different from the school in our hometown.

12:56.680 --> 12:58.000
They use multimedia in school.

12:58.040 --> 12:59.440
I have to figure it out.

13:01.410 --> 13:02.290
Well,

13:02.650 --> 13:04.090
the class of the third grade is early.

13:04.530 --> 13:05.680
I have to go first.

13:06.090 --> 13:07.890
Xianxian, I can't wait for you.

13:24.090 --> 13:25.600
Sister, I'm sorry.

13:26.410 --> 13:28.090
I was wrong yesterday.

13:28.680 --> 13:30.330
I shouldn't take your diary

13:30.480 --> 13:32.040
without your permission,

13:32.440 --> 13:34.890
and broke it.

13:37.890 --> 13:39.330
Sister, I have realized my fault.

13:39.920 --> 13:41.410
Can you forgive me?

13:43.480 --> 13:44.480
Sister, please.

13:44.650 --> 13:45.770
Forgive me.

13:45.920 --> 13:48.090
If you don't forgive me, mom will beat me.

13:49.290 --> 13:50.290
Did you say it?

13:53.680 --> 13:54.650
Look.

13:59.560 --> 14:01.440
Don't touch my stuff anymore.

14:01.560 --> 14:02.680
Okay, you have my word.

14:05.330 --> 14:07.210
Ding Xian, let me fill your bowl

14:07.360 --> 14:08.970
with your favorite Egg Meat Porridge.

14:33.800 --> 14:34.770
Can you stop looking?

14:35.090 --> 14:35.970
Annoying.

14:37.770 --> 14:38.730
Please don't mind.

14:38.890 --> 14:40.000
He is just this kind of person.

14:40.240 --> 14:41.240
My name is Liu Xiaofeng.

14:41.480 --> 14:42.770
Nice to meet you.

14:44.850 --> 14:45.800
Ding Xian

14:45.970 --> 14:47.480
Are you familiar with Zhou Siyue?

14:48.090 --> 14:48.920
No, I'm not.

14:49.090 --> 14:50.000
You are not?

14:50.330 --> 14:51.920
Then why did he put something into your drawer

14:52.090 --> 14:53.440
before you came in.

15:02.210 --> 15:02.970
Take it back.

15:04.210 --> 15:06.000
My mother told me to bring it to you.

15:07.560 --> 15:09.480
Anyway, I can't accept anything from you.

15:10.120 --> 15:11.410
This is Golden Cake.

15:11.650 --> 15:12.890
I have been thinking about it for a long time.

15:13.650 --> 15:14.560
Well.

15:14.770 --> 15:15.730
You can have it.

15:16.040 --> 15:18.330
Siyue, your mother is so good at buying things.

15:19.800 --> 15:20.850
Come on.

15:21.000 --> 15:22.120
Are you really not familiar with him?

15:22.330 --> 15:23.360
I admire him so much.

15:23.560 --> 15:24.800
He is the legend at National Olympiads.

15:25.240 --> 15:27.600
Looking at the way he solves problems is so enjoyable.

15:27.890 --> 15:29.290
It's art!

15:30.040 --> 15:30.770
I didn't expect that

15:30.920 --> 15:32.920
I could be in the same class with my idol.

15:33.360 --> 15:34.360
You are so noisy.

15:36.170 --> 15:37.600
You only dare to pick up on a pushover.

15:37.770 --> 15:38.850
When Deng Wanwan was here,

15:39.040 --> 15:40.240
you weren't so bad-tempered.

15:56.170 --> 15:57.330
Watch it!

16:00.170 --> 16:01.120
It's dusty.

16:01.290 --> 16:02.530
Can you do it in the back?

16:04.530 --> 16:05.650
Sorry.

16:16.000 --> 16:18.240
He Xingwen has gone too far.

16:18.890 --> 16:19.970
He has always been this way.

16:20.360 --> 16:22.360
A nerd only knows study.

16:22.770 --> 16:24.290
Little Monster will go through hard days

16:24.600 --> 16:26.170
after sitting next to him.

16:28.040 --> 16:28.850
Am I right?

16:29.560 --> 16:30.890
I'm not familiar with him.

16:31.040 --> 16:32.210
How do I know?

16:32.850 --> 16:33.920
You're not familiar with him,

16:34.120 --> 16:35.240
but he is familiar with you.

16:35.890 --> 16:37.090
Remember, when we were in junior high school,

16:37.120 --> 16:39.040
both of you were competing for the No.1 of the math exam.

16:39.290 --> 16:40.240
You were sick then,

16:40.330 --> 16:41.800
so you got second place.

16:42.000 --> 16:43.330
He was happy for an entire week.

16:43.920 --> 16:44.730
Really?

16:45.680 --> 16:46.650
Really.

16:47.330 --> 16:48.000
You were not in the same class with us

16:48.170 --> 16:49.090
in junior high school.

16:49.290 --> 16:50.330
Let me tell you, that day,

16:50.560 --> 16:52.650
Siyue got a fever of more than 40℃.

16:52.850 --> 16:53.480
He still insisted on taking the exam.

17:07.570 --> 17:08.570
Liu Xiaofeng

17:08.890 --> 17:10.959
Did you give out all the math papers?

17:11.080 --> 17:12.719
Yeah, but you were not there then.

17:12.930 --> 17:14.290
He Xingwen must have kept it for you.

17:19.450 --> 17:20.320
He Xingwen

17:20.650 --> 17:22.770
Have you kept the exam paper for me?

17:22.890 --> 17:23.959
I have no obligation to keep it for you.

17:24.600 --> 17:27.080
You can ask the Subject Representative
for that.

17:42.080 --> 17:44.690
Do you have extra paper

17:44.840 --> 17:45.960
that the teacher left?

17:46.170 --> 17:48.360
I gave back all the extra papers to the teacher.

17:49.480 --> 17:51.170
What? Your deskmate didn't keep it for you?

17:51.720 --> 17:52.410
That's okay.

17:52.570 --> 17:54.170
I'll ask the teacher for it.

17:59.290 --> 18:00.650
Poor Little Monster.

18:01.360 --> 18:02.810
Having such a deskmate.

18:03.690 --> 18:05.240
Isn't our Siyue nice enough?

18:06.450 --> 18:08.200
What does it have to do with me?

18:08.410 --> 18:09.320
Why doesn't it have something to do with you?

18:09.840 --> 18:11.360
If she hadn't change seats,

18:11.530 --> 18:14.240
she couldn't have reduced to such a condition.

18:14.450 --> 18:16.170
If you had given out paper well,

18:16.320 --> 18:18.080
she wouldn't have been bullied by He Xingwen.

18:18.480 --> 18:19.450
Right.

18:19.600 --> 18:20.960
You have done a bad job.

18:21.170 --> 18:22.810
Don't make me the scapegoat.

18:22.960 --> 18:23.890
He is right.

18:24.600 --> 18:25.600
Both of you.

18:25.810 --> 18:28.170
Alright, I'll be more careful next time.

18:28.360 --> 18:29.290
Next time.

18:35.360 --> 18:36.450
Mr. Liu

18:37.080 --> 18:38.650
Do you have any extra exam papers?

18:42.600 --> 18:44.410
If only you had been here earlier.

18:44.650 --> 18:45.960
Just now, Class 6 was short of paper.

18:46.120 --> 18:47.480
They took all that left.

18:48.890 --> 18:50.000
In the teacher's office of third grade,

18:50.050 --> 18:51.570
there seems to be a separate printer.

18:51.770 --> 18:54.360
You can use this to copy one.

18:54.650 --> 18:55.290
Okay.

18:56.240 --> 18:58.000
-Thanks, Mr. Liu.  -Go ahead.

19:10.320 --> 19:12.000
We gave so many gifts on the Teacher's day.

19:12.600 --> 19:13.480
This new teacher

19:13.480 --> 19:14.690
seems haven't received any gift.

19:15.240 --> 19:16.050
Never mind, let's go.

19:16.050 --> 19:16.480
Go.

19:36.840 --> 19:37.480
Hello, Mr. Ding.

19:37.810 --> 19:38.240
Hello.

19:40.720 --> 19:41.570
Xianxian

19:42.650 --> 19:43.480
Dad

19:44.450 --> 19:45.450
Why are you here?

19:48.530 --> 19:50.570
How about I wait for you after school?

19:53.840 --> 19:54.810
Alright.

19:59.050 --> 19:59.770
Xianxian

20:00.650 --> 20:03.410
I know you are detail-oriented.

20:04.450 --> 20:06.320
In the new environment, with new people around.

20:07.050 --> 20:09.600
Let's adapt to it together.

20:10.570 --> 20:13.600
This is called Father and Daughter Alliance.

20:13.840 --> 20:14.810
Do you like it?

20:21.810 --> 20:23.320
I'll buy you some chestnuts.

20:23.770 --> 20:25.600
It was your favorite when you were young.

20:26.650 --> 20:27.480
Wait for me here.

20:43.570 --> 20:44.810
Dear Xianxian,

20:45.570 --> 20:46.720
this diary book

20:46.890 --> 20:48.930
is a gift of the new term for you.

20:51.200 --> 20:53.080
Coming into a strange environment,

20:53.770 --> 20:55.770
a girl sensitive as you must have got

20:56.450 --> 20:59.000
a lot of new thoughts and secrets,

20:59.890 --> 21:03.530
and some unspeakable feelings.

21:04.120 --> 21:05.720
Although you never told us,

21:06.530 --> 21:08.770
I understand you, and I will always stand by you.

21:09.650 --> 21:10.930
Let's do our best together.

21:11.650 --> 21:13.480
Go ahead, Xianxian.

21:14.120 --> 21:15.650
It turns out that dad is just like me,

21:16.840 --> 21:19.450
he also needs to adapt to the new environment.

21:20.770 --> 21:21.570
Dad

21:22.600 --> 21:24.290
I'll do my best with you.

21:29.600 --> 21:30.450
Xianxian

21:30.930 --> 21:31.450
Here you are.

21:32.120 --> 21:32.890
Thanks, dad.

21:38.320 --> 21:39.080
What is this?

21:43.360 --> 21:44.360
Dad

21:44.930 --> 21:46.240
Happy Teacher's Day!

21:52.840 --> 21:53.480
I'm happy.

21:55.170 --> 21:57.530
My girl is getting
more and more considerate.

21:59.450 --> 22:00.530
Let me hold this for you.

22:01.810 --> 22:02.480
Let's go.

22:07.290 --> 22:07.840
Let's go.

22:29.770 --> 22:31.570
Ding, Xianxian

22:32.080 --> 22:33.050
Are you going for a walk?

22:33.360 --> 22:34.930
-Auntie.  -I'm picking up Siyue.

22:35.360 --> 22:37.480
Look, he is just behind you.

22:38.050 --> 22:38.570
Siyue

22:38.650 --> 22:39.290
Uncle Ding

22:40.570 --> 22:42.890
Why is Zhou Zongtang still not back?

22:42.960 --> 22:44.810
I am waiting for him to drink with me.

22:45.480 --> 22:47.450
You two should drink less.

22:47.600 --> 22:48.720
You two are not in the twenties.

22:48.890 --> 22:50.080
Mind your health.

22:51.570 --> 22:52.600
Well, Xianxian.

22:52.840 --> 22:54.530
The Golden Cake I gave you,

22:54.690 --> 22:55.570
does it taste good?

22:57.480 --> 22:58.360
It's tasty.

22:58.930 --> 23:00.050
I ate it up.

23:00.200 --> 23:01.890
Really? That's good.

23:02.120 --> 23:03.690
I'll buy you more.

23:04.320 --> 23:05.240
Thanks, auntie.

23:05.450 --> 23:05.960
Thanks a lot.

23:05.960 --> 23:06.840
No problem.

23:07.360 --> 23:09.290
The two kids really get along well.

23:09.720 --> 23:10.650
Just like when you and Zhou

23:10.690 --> 23:12.170
were at school.

23:12.650 --> 23:13.320
That's true.

23:13.410 --> 23:14.720
Nonsense.

23:15.240 --> 23:17.000
Ate them up? Wouldn't you be afraid of bursting your stomach?

23:17.770 --> 23:19.000
I thought you were fooling me.

23:19.530 --> 23:21.120
It was actually sent by your mother.

23:24.650 --> 23:26.690
I think they can go to school

23:27.240 --> 23:28.810
and go home together.

23:28.930 --> 23:29.770
Right.

23:30.530 --> 23:31.810
Go to school and go home together.

23:32.050 --> 23:34.000
We can cook breakfast in turn.

23:34.120 --> 23:35.000
That's even more convenient.

23:35.200 --> 23:35.770
Okay.

23:35.840 --> 23:37.690
Why didn't it occur to me earlier?

23:37.720 --> 23:38.570
Good.

23:39.050 --> 23:40.690
Siyue, don't ride your bike anymore.

23:40.960 --> 23:41.720
You can walk to school

23:41.840 --> 23:43.200
together with Xianxian.

23:44.000 --> 23:44.840
Is that okay, Siyue?

23:45.320 --> 23:46.890
If you go home and go to school together with Xianxian,

23:47.000 --> 23:47.960
I'll rest assured.

23:48.080 --> 23:48.650
Is it okay?

23:50.840 --> 23:51.410
OK.

23:51.770 --> 23:52.480
Absolutely okay.

23:52.890 --> 23:54.170
That's great.

23:54.450 --> 23:55.720
You two are

23:55.930 --> 23:56.930
in the same class at school.

23:57.480 --> 23:59.480
You should help each other.

23:59.600 --> 24:00.450
Sure thing.

24:01.170 --> 24:02.770
Ding Xian gets along with me

24:03.530 --> 24:04.770
really well

24:06.290 --> 24:07.410
in the class.

24:08.080 --> 24:08.650
Great!

24:08.650 --> 24:09.570
So great!

24:09.600 --> 24:10.200
Yeah.

24:11.450 --> 24:12.360
Let's make it a deal.

24:12.410 --> 24:12.690
OK.

24:12.690 --> 24:13.770
I'll cook tomorrow morning.

24:14.240 --> 24:14.720
Alright.

24:14.720 --> 24:16.450
You were quite good at acting.

24:17.810 --> 24:18.290
You too.

24:18.450 --> 24:19.320
I'll make the food the day after tomorrow.

24:19.360 --> 24:19.960
Okay.

24:20.000 --> 24:20.290
Bye.

24:20.320 --> 24:21.000
Alright, bye-bye.

24:21.050 --> 24:22.050
-Bye.  -Bye.

24:24.000 --> 24:24.530
Give it to me.

25:04.080 --> 25:05.080
Ding Xian

25:05.320 --> 25:06.570
Mrs. Li brought you something,

25:06.650 --> 25:07.810
why didn't you tell us?

25:08.200 --> 25:09.960
Later, I'll prepare something for you.

25:10.320 --> 25:11.890
Don't forget to return her kindness.

25:14.000 --> 25:14.810
Alright, I got it.

25:31.200 --> 25:32.000
Good morning, Siyue.

25:32.290 --> 25:32.840
Morning.

25:43.960 --> 25:44.890
What's up?

25:45.690 --> 25:46.890
Zhou Siyue

25:48.570 --> 25:49.600
Breakfast.

25:51.240 --> 25:52.320
Marinated Eggs again?

25:53.000 --> 25:54.000
Really?

25:56.000 --> 25:57.480
Don't you like Marinated Eggs?

25:58.170 --> 25:59.720
No, I don't like it.

25:59.930 --> 26:01.600
If you don't like it, you can throw it away.

26:06.930 --> 26:07.810
Are you going or not?

26:10.200 --> 26:11.810
If you're in a hurry, you can go first.

26:13.410 --> 26:15.480
If it wasn't our parents' request,

26:15.960 --> 26:17.600
do you think I would wait for you?

26:21.600 --> 26:22.840
Master Zhou

26:23.360 --> 26:25.240
We can only pretend in front of them.

26:25.770 --> 26:27.200
Do you really take it seriously?

26:36.960 --> 26:38.530
Ding Xian, if you don't want to eat it,

26:38.690 --> 26:39.690
I can help you.

26:41.720 --> 26:42.450
Here you are.

26:43.360 --> 26:45.000
I didn't think you are actually so generous.

26:49.170 --> 26:49.770
Young master

26:49.890 --> 26:51.530
You've been working hard so early in the morning?

26:51.720 --> 26:52.930
Stop fussing.

26:58.410 --> 26:59.120
Stand up.

27:01.450 --> 27:04.290
Good morning, sir.

27:04.530 --> 27:05.200
Sit down, please.

27:07.530 --> 27:08.840
This is a free study class.

27:09.450 --> 27:11.120
I'll give out a piece of paper to you.

27:11.530 --> 27:12.930
I have to go out for a meeting.

27:13.450 --> 27:14.290
Come on, you three.

27:14.320 --> 27:15.770
Distribute the paper, please.

27:21.240 --> 27:21.930
Deng Wanwan

27:22.410 --> 27:22.840
Yes.

27:23.000 --> 27:24.570
You will be responsible for
the class discipline.

27:25.170 --> 27:26.570
If someone talks,

27:26.930 --> 27:28.480
take down their names.

27:29.120 --> 27:30.570
I'll punish them when I come back.

27:30.600 --> 27:31.240
Alright.

27:33.810 --> 27:35.000
Behave yourself.

27:41.570 --> 27:43.240
Now everybody, stop talking.

27:43.240 --> 27:44.410
I'm ready to take down names.

27:55.930 --> 27:56.960
Liu Xiaofeng

27:57.810 --> 28:00.050
Can I use your math notes?

28:01.650 --> 28:04.290
Notes, math notes.

28:04.290 --> 28:04.930
Deng Wanwan

28:05.480 --> 28:07.320
Ding Xian and Liu Xiaofeng are distracting me.

28:08.240 --> 28:09.080
He Xingwen

28:10.050 --> 28:11.570
Ding Xian was just borrowing notes
from me.

28:11.930 --> 28:12.810
We were not chit-chatting.

28:12.810 --> 28:13.810
How did we distract you?

28:14.770 --> 28:15.450
Never mind.

28:20.690 --> 28:21.450
Look.

28:21.770 --> 28:22.960
Names were taken down.

28:57.810 --> 28:58.530
Mr. Liu

28:59.170 --> 29:00.890
Ding Xian was just borrowing notes from me.

29:01.170 --> 29:02.570
We didn't chitchat.

29:04.170 --> 29:04.930
Borrowing notes?

29:05.720 --> 29:08.000
Why didn't do it when the class was off?

29:09.480 --> 29:10.480
I think you just

29:10.600 --> 29:12.890
don't take the study seriously.

29:14.000 --> 29:15.200
Both borrowing notes,

29:15.890 --> 29:17.290
and changing seats.

29:17.650 --> 29:20.080
Don't you think I couldn't find it out?

29:21.770 --> 29:23.050
Do you, Ding Xian?

29:24.650 --> 29:27.120
Mr. Liu, I know I was wrong.

29:29.720 --> 29:32.450
Ding Xian, I don't want to criticize you,

29:32.930 --> 29:34.810
but you really have to

29:34.810 --> 29:35.530
adjust yourself recently.

29:35.530 --> 29:36.650
Auntie Liu has gone mad.

29:37.600 --> 29:38.320
Look at you!

29:38.360 --> 29:38.720
Mr. Liu

29:38.720 --> 29:39.530
You have...

29:40.290 --> 29:41.050
I want to report.

29:41.480 --> 29:43.050
Song Ziqi also chatted in the class.

29:44.050 --> 29:46.480
Song Ziqi, how could you be so bold?

29:46.960 --> 29:47.810
Stand up.

29:56.450 --> 29:57.720
Not only me,

29:58.930 --> 30:01.600
Kong Disha and the guy behind me

30:02.360 --> 30:03.410
also chatted.

30:03.890 --> 30:05.120
And, so did He Xingwen.

30:08.600 --> 30:09.840
Stand up, all of you guys.

30:16.290 --> 30:18.890
You seem to be honest now.

30:19.720 --> 30:21.050
You are good.

30:21.450 --> 30:22.480
You are under great pressure,

30:22.480 --> 30:24.360
but you still have time to chitchat.

30:24.810 --> 30:26.410
If you have nothing to do,

30:26.530 --> 30:27.770
don't leave after school.

30:28.000 --> 30:29.170
Do the cleaning here.

30:29.600 --> 30:31.080
Don't go home before it is finished.

30:34.000 --> 30:34.770
It's all your fault.

30:44.960 --> 30:45.650
What are you looking at?

30:46.890 --> 30:47.480
Sorry.

30:50.480 --> 30:51.050
Feel good?

31:14.450 --> 31:16.570
Ding Xian, why are you being so obnoxious.

31:17.000 --> 31:17.840
If it wasn't you,

31:17.960 --> 31:19.320
I wouldn't have been here doing the cleaning.

31:19.840 --> 31:21.290
Why haven't I got one peaceful day

31:21.480 --> 31:23.080
since you moved beside me?

31:23.290 --> 31:25.120
He Xingwen, don't go too far.

31:25.690 --> 31:26.810
What did Ding Xian do to you?

31:27.290 --> 31:28.600
Why did you aim at her anytime?

31:28.930 --> 31:29.650
Why?

31:30.170 --> 31:32.080
Why do you always speak for her?

31:32.450 --> 31:33.480
Who are you to her?

31:33.690 --> 31:36.240
He Xingwen, how can you talk in this way?

31:36.450 --> 31:37.960
You are not gentlemanly at all.

31:38.120 --> 31:40.050
If you go on like this, be careful that Siyue may beat you.

31:41.290 --> 31:42.200
What does it have to do with me?

31:42.690 --> 31:44.170
Just kidding, just kidding.

31:47.170 --> 31:48.240
Wait and see, you all.

31:55.770 --> 31:56.530
Mr. Ding

31:56.890 --> 31:57.770
Mr. Liu, you are off the class?

31:58.120 --> 31:58.960
Are you busy?

31:59.360 --> 31:59.890
No, I'm not.

32:00.320 --> 32:01.290
I want to have a word with you.

32:01.530 --> 32:02.320
Alright, please.

32:02.600 --> 32:04.890
Have you heard about that

32:05.170 --> 32:07.170
there was a student in Class 8, Grade 3.

32:07.650 --> 32:09.320
He had always been the top student,

32:09.690 --> 32:12.000
but later he fell out with his classmate.

32:12.530 --> 32:14.650
After that, his grades descended sharply.

32:15.320 --> 32:16.200
Really?

32:17.360 --> 32:18.200
In my view,

32:18.720 --> 32:20.290
academic performance is indeed important,

32:21.050 --> 32:22.810
but the relationship in school is also important.

32:23.360 --> 32:24.690
It shouldn't be ignored.

32:26.240 --> 32:26.840
Mr. Liu

32:26.840 --> 32:29.240
Did Xianxian have some problems?

32:29.840 --> 32:31.120
To speak frankly,

32:31.600 --> 32:33.770
a student reported to me

32:34.360 --> 32:36.810
that Ding Xian had some arguments with her classmate.

32:45.200 --> 32:46.240
Let me help you.

32:47.530 --> 32:48.410
Thanks.

32:50.960 --> 32:51.840
Don't mention it.

32:52.080 --> 32:54.240
You spoke for me before.

32:54.480 --> 32:56.120
I haven't thanked you yet.

32:57.890 --> 32:59.240
But I have never seen someone

32:59.240 --> 33:00.360
so irrational.

33:00.650 --> 33:01.290
He deserves it.

33:04.120 --> 33:05.960
Ding Xian, He Xingwen is so annoying.

33:06.120 --> 33:07.170
Why don't you change back?

33:07.320 --> 33:08.200
Let's take a break.

33:10.050 --> 33:12.360
No, the class supervisor just said that.

33:12.960 --> 33:14.360
It's impossible to change back now.

33:15.320 --> 33:16.450
It's all Deng Wanwan's fault.

33:16.840 --> 33:18.450
If she hadn't taken your seat,

33:18.450 --> 33:19.690
there wouldn't have been so many troubles.

33:20.960 --> 33:21.960
Never mind, let it be.

33:22.720 --> 33:23.240
Let's go.

33:23.890 --> 33:24.410
Let me do it.

33:37.720 --> 33:38.690
Can you not

33:38.840 --> 33:39.650
walk around all-day

33:39.770 --> 33:40.960
with a thermos flask in your hand.

33:41.450 --> 33:42.810
It's so annoying.

33:43.600 --> 33:46.170
Your daughter had conflicts with others in school,

33:46.450 --> 33:48.480
aren't you worried?

33:48.690 --> 33:49.960
She only has to do good in her lessons.

33:50.240 --> 33:52.080
Such a young kid, what relationship do they need?

33:52.530 --> 33:54.960
I'm telling you, this is bias.

33:56.960 --> 33:58.240
Let's go to the arcade this weekend.

33:58.840 --> 33:59.650
Okay.

34:02.960 --> 34:04.770
We can call Deng Wanwan with us.

34:07.450 --> 34:08.480
She asked me.

34:09.930 --> 34:11.410
Actually, I think,

34:11.839 --> 34:13.760
Deng Wanwan is not that obnoxious.

34:13.930 --> 34:14.890
She is cordial.

34:15.319 --> 34:17.839
She is not like Little Monster, who is like a piece of wood,

34:18.250 --> 34:19.170
and easy to get angry.

34:19.170 --> 34:19.600
Do you remember...

34:19.600 --> 34:20.490
So noisy!

34:23.359 --> 34:24.010
Did I get an auditory hallucination?

34:24.010 --> 34:25.690
I seem to have heard the voice of Little Monster.

34:26.279 --> 34:27.890
Couldn't you keep your voice down?

34:29.319 --> 34:30.010
Do you hear that?

34:30.600 --> 34:31.560
She is so sensitive.

34:50.210 --> 34:51.010
Xianxian

34:51.930 --> 34:52.690
Dad

34:55.010 --> 34:55.600
Here you are.

35:01.210 --> 35:02.080
This is...

35:02.690 --> 35:04.800
This is some snacks for you, I'm worried about you being tired.

35:05.490 --> 35:06.170
Enjoy it.

35:06.930 --> 35:07.650
Thanks, dad.

35:17.560 --> 35:19.490
Look at this year's Olympic Games,

35:19.690 --> 35:21.170
our country

35:21.650 --> 35:23.450
is so strong now.

35:23.730 --> 35:24.760
Dad

35:25.410 --> 35:27.760
Wasn't the Olympic Games held last year?

35:29.080 --> 35:29.890
Last year?

35:32.210 --> 35:34.170
I took the newspaper randomly.

35:34.170 --> 35:35.650
It was one of last year's newspapers.

35:38.280 --> 35:39.280
Xianxian

35:39.600 --> 35:42.010
You have read

35:42.490 --> 35:44.360
the current political news, right?

35:44.690 --> 35:45.650
Yeah.

35:46.010 --> 35:47.800
Our teachers told us to read the news more often.

35:47.930 --> 35:48.800
It may appear on the exam paper.

35:48.800 --> 35:49.560
Yeah, that's right.

35:51.080 --> 35:52.730
Since I'm here,

35:52.970 --> 35:54.930
let me talk with you more about that.

35:55.690 --> 35:57.520
You know, our country is

35:57.690 --> 35:59.650
getting more and more powerful

35:59.800 --> 36:01.080
in the world.

36:01.280 --> 36:03.410
We have launched the first

36:03.650 --> 36:05.040
man-made moon orbiting satellite,

36:05.250 --> 36:07.360
and we held the Olympic Games last year.

36:07.600 --> 36:08.600
You know how many countries

36:08.800 --> 36:10.320
gave us a thumb-up?

36:11.210 --> 36:12.120
But

36:12.360 --> 36:14.210
we have to maintain stable minds

36:14.560 --> 36:15.730
and keep developing.

36:17.410 --> 36:18.360
Diplomacy.

36:19.120 --> 36:21.650
Especially the relationship with other countries.

36:21.800 --> 36:22.970
We have to maintain it well.

36:23.210 --> 36:24.490
Do you know why?

36:26.280 --> 36:28.250
Let me be simple with you.

36:28.250 --> 36:29.490
Let me give you a metaphor,

36:29.490 --> 36:30.080
alright?

36:30.930 --> 36:33.650
For example the earth

36:34.320 --> 36:35.320
is your class.

36:36.760 --> 36:39.170
You are China.

36:39.450 --> 36:41.840
The countries of the world

36:42.280 --> 36:44.120
are your classmates.

36:44.600 --> 36:45.360
China.

36:46.800 --> 36:47.650
You.

36:47.930 --> 36:48.760
China.

36:49.280 --> 36:51.520
If you want to

36:51.690 --> 36:53.250
develop well in this class,

36:53.520 --> 36:56.210
what do you have to do?

36:56.490 --> 36:57.450
I have to

36:59.970 --> 37:01.170
be self-independent and strong

37:01.490 --> 37:03.010
so that you can earn the respect.

37:03.690 --> 37:05.560
It's true for a country,

37:05.730 --> 37:07.320
true for a nation,

37:07.520 --> 37:09.040
also true for a person.

37:09.490 --> 37:11.120
You have to seize the fate

37:11.280 --> 37:12.560
in your hands at any time.

37:12.730 --> 37:14.890
That's the style of a major country.

37:15.650 --> 37:17.080
That's what our teacher said.

37:22.560 --> 37:23.560
It makes sense.

37:23.970 --> 37:24.970
But

37:25.250 --> 37:26.840
I think that...

37:30.120 --> 37:32.210
I think you should eat fewer snacks.

37:32.520 --> 37:33.120
Let me tell you,

37:33.520 --> 37:35.250
tomorrow, bring these snacks

37:35.250 --> 37:36.320
to your class,

37:36.450 --> 37:37.840
and share them with your classmates.

37:38.040 --> 37:39.690
And also this box of chocolate,

37:39.890 --> 37:41.010
bring it to Zhou Siyue.

37:41.760 --> 37:43.080
No, I won't.

37:43.450 --> 37:44.490
You...

37:44.730 --> 37:45.600
That's a must.

37:47.560 --> 37:48.890
Eat less.

37:49.080 --> 37:50.120
It makes you fat.

37:51.040 --> 37:51.840
Study hard.

38:04.970 --> 38:06.320
Bring them to classmates.

38:09.040 --> 38:10.010
Who should I give?

38:17.600 --> 38:18.360
Mr. Ding

38:19.560 --> 38:20.120
Siyue

38:20.320 --> 38:20.560
Good morning!

38:20.560 --> 38:21.320
Good morning!

38:22.520 --> 38:23.600
Siyue, wait a moment.

38:23.970 --> 38:24.800
Well...

38:25.690 --> 38:26.450
Siyue

38:26.970 --> 38:28.450
Let me ask you something.

38:29.120 --> 38:30.520
Did something happen to

38:30.970 --> 38:32.170
Xianxian in school

38:32.210 --> 38:33.320
that made her unhappy?

38:35.800 --> 38:37.450
What's wrong, Uncle Ding?

38:38.760 --> 38:40.280
Recently, I feel that

38:40.360 --> 38:41.650
Xianxian has been unhappy when she is at home.

38:42.360 --> 38:43.320
I asked her,

38:43.650 --> 38:44.760
but she didn't tell me.

38:45.170 --> 38:46.360
I'm afraid that she has met

38:46.410 --> 38:47.970
some troubles in school?

38:49.970 --> 38:51.730
Alright, rest assured, Uncle Ding.

38:51.930 --> 38:54.360
I'll pay more attention to her in class.

38:54.560 --> 38:56.210
Okay, thank you, Siyue.

38:56.210 --> 38:58.250
Come to my house for dinner when you're free.

39:00.600 --> 39:01.080
Dad

39:01.170 --> 39:01.730
Xianxian

39:02.320 --> 39:03.600
You two go ahead to school, I gotta go.

39:14.120 --> 39:15.250
Are you not going to the class?

39:15.280 --> 39:16.080
It's gonna be late.

39:39.280 --> 39:40.170
You walk inside.

39:41.490 --> 39:42.490
Thank you.

39:45.120 --> 39:46.040
Little Monster, Siyue.

39:47.120 --> 39:48.040
Why do you two

39:48.600 --> 39:50.040
walk so close.

39:52.040 --> 39:52.890
No, we don't.

39:55.410 --> 39:56.080
Why are you running?

40:02.840 --> 40:03.600
What's wrong?

40:03.600 --> 40:05.040
Why do you bring so many snacks?

40:06.170 --> 40:07.410
It's my father.

40:07.600 --> 40:08.930
He insisted on letting me do the diplomacy,

40:09.600 --> 40:12.010
and to promote relationships with
my classmates by sharing these snacks.

40:12.600 --> 40:14.040
Then why don't you share with them?

40:16.210 --> 40:17.690
I don't know who I should share with.

40:18.010 --> 40:19.210
I racked my brains,

40:19.800 --> 40:21.170
and I find that I'm familiar with you the most.

40:23.280 --> 40:25.490
Xianxian, getting along with classmates

40:25.690 --> 40:26.970
can be step by step.

40:27.170 --> 40:27.970
As time goes by,

40:28.170 --> 40:29.210
You'll find that everyone

40:29.210 --> 40:30.490
can be nice.

40:32.650 --> 40:33.410
I trust you.

40:34.250 --> 40:34.930
You can make it.

40:41.760 --> 40:42.520
I can make it.

40:46.120 --> 40:47.280
Alright everyone, dismiss now.

40:47.410 --> 40:48.170
